      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n1024✨G3陀螺官方賽✨<br />\n<br />\n兩個月一期的G3的官方賽<br />\n最後一場在今天結束囉~<br />\n感謝所有來賓的參與<br />\n也恭喜這幾次前三名拿到限定零件的朋友唷😊<br />\n<br />\n11.12月如果還有安排G3賽事<br />\n一樣會在海電電FB粉絲團公告<br />\n請大家持續鎖定唷👍<br />\n<br />\n#戰鬥陀螺 #官方賽 #台南 #海佃 #湯姆熊<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861525438_1562568199224784_4573749370854393874_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=yeSh29o1KzUQ7kNvwHyxevX&amp;_nc_oc=AdpOlM_g5A3UiDE9Vqvb6AIQXmii-pkQOEUv8N3ptg1tVIXrgSZJ_o2bEWwheMyN9bE&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=WBj-nIENqhcuSQlYEEhvJw&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQK7w6c49fpCSH7MWJ6-_lvS9ym-OEK3pbkYQDaxB0mFsGfOWBG1FQjRkZiL5HuUZB1EmDc-r91v&amp;oh=00_AQQLQMtZhwp1Rx77aXmrX9cOUVUTcxYZLyEhEneJ1WC9NA&amp;oe=6AE6F164\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/862850795_1562568812558056_5073562579851793284_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=PiSajGgGFVoQ7kNvwHJgLA8&amp;_nc_oc=Adp93f-kKWrdC0-c1NIadf0SE6dsZNNVSDfi3l6gCYRb9vXOdM_kAN9q_HQk5nPHs7U&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=WBj-nIENqhcuSQlYEEhvJw&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKhmHzqLjF77waJIoU1cef5GwUjowTFL6NrD-n0fw50CYarj0i3bg1YZ3mNQ-Xl_2wA0RVdCqFf&amp;oh=00_AQTu79cgWkgNCd6hvu0Sm_jtoYMOpWjqr1OkU_5pCce-YA&amp;oe=6AE6E1C5\" width=\"720\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861217877_1562568825891388_430941940602498468_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=8gGK6F23LXUQ7kNvwHBymLn&amp;_nc_oc=AdrEjwgI57wVFqHLCAAkT4ntUHil_jSGppF2qJJuvFt64vpFG5pTZgN4ZcHRKkzHCLg&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=WBj-nIENqhcuSQlYEEhvJw&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJPDn-3gSc3QboZjVKT_YRzPVEV_ozrXNAE6XrZyjgi7X